plifies complex concepts and helps readers make informed decisions.","sameAs":["https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/","https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/durjey-kayath-513b34199\/"],"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/author\/durjey-kayath\/"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599782665","position":1,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599782665","name":"1. Do I need a degree to start a career in digital marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No, a specific degree is not mandatory. Many successful digital marketers come from completely unrelated academic backgrounds. What matters more is practical\u00a0skill, a strong portfolio, and the ability to show\u00a0real results.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599792313","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599792313","name":"2. How to start\u00a0career\u00a0in digital marketing with no experience?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start by learning the fundamentals through free or paid courses, then build your own small projects, such as a blog, a social media page, or a mock ad campaign. This hands-on work becomes your experience even before your first job.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599805730","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599805730","name":"3. How long does it take to become job-ready in digital marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most beginners can become job-ready within three to six months if they follow a structured course, practice consistently, and build a small portfolio alongside their learning.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599822278","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599822278","name":"4. Which digital marketing skill is best for beginners to start with?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SEO and content marketing are often recommended as starting points because they build\u00a0a strong foundation\u00a0in how search engines and audiences think, which makes it easier to understand other channels like PPC and social media later.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599839504","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599839504","name":"5. What is the average salary for a digital marketing fresher in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Freshers in India typically earn between \u20b92.5 LPA and \u20b95 LPA depending on their role, skills, certifications, and city, with performance marketing and analytics roles often starting higher due to strong demand and limited talent supply.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599854584","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599854584","name":"6. Can I work as a freelancer right after learning digital marketing?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It is possible, but it is usually easier to gain some real campaign experience through an internship or entry-level job first. This experience helps you handle client expectations and real budgets more confidently before going independent.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599881556","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-career-in-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1783599881556","name":"7. Is digital marketing a good long-term career\u00a0option?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, digital marketing continues to grow as more businesses shift their budgets online. With continuous learning, professionals can move from entry-level roles into strategic and leadership positions over several years.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/21384","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/15"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=21384"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/21384\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21498,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/21384\/revisions\/21498"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/21386"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=21384"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetec